  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Given below are two statement : one is labelled as Assertion A and the other is labelled as Reason R&nbsp;:</p><p>Assertion A&nbsp;: Size of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Bk</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> ion is less than <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Np</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> ion.</p><p>Reason R :&nbsp;The above is a consequence of the lanthanide contraction.</p><p>In the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below :</p>",
